@host = http://localhost:5042

### Get the country/capital data set
GET {{host}}/api/game
Accept: application/json

### Submit a completed game (valid -> 201)
POST {{host}}/api/game/results
Content-Type: application/json

{ "elapsedSeconds": 42, "wrongAttempts": 3, "hintsUsed": 1 }

### Submit with a negative value (-> 400)
POST {{host}}/api/game/results
Content-Type: application/json

{ "elapsedSeconds": 42, "wrongAttempts": -1, "hintsUsed": 0 }
